2, Hmah, Htail, and Hmax, respectively. These frequencies describe resampling behavior
in one dataset rather than population power. The framework offers an adaptive way to
combine mean and rank evidence without selecting one channel in advance.
Keywords: high-dimensional; two-sample test; permutation; variance reweighted mean; rank
order statistics; adaptive.
